message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Automated Essay Scoring System for Bangla Language"
abstract: >-
  Fine-tuning transformer encoders (Bangla BERT, IndicBERT, MuRIL) and
  decoder-only large language models (Falcon, Llama) to score university-level
  Bangla essays as a regression task. Undergraduate thesis, Department of
  Computer Science and Engineering, BRAC University.
type: software
